sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant M as Mobile
    participant A as API
    participant DB as BDD

    M->>A: POST /events/:id/register<br/>Authorization: Bearer <token>
    A->>A: Hook authenticate (vérifie JWT)
    A->>DB: SELECT event WHERE id = :id<br/>FOR UPDATE
    DB-->>A: event { capacity, current_attendees }

    alt Capacité atteinte
        A-->>M: 409 Conflict<br/>{ error: "Event is full" }
    else Place disponible
        A->>DB: INSERT INTO event_registrations
        DB-->>A: OK
        A->>DB: UPDATE events SET current_attendees++
        DB-->>A: OK
        A->>A: Service createNotification
        A-->>M: 201 Created<br/>{ registration }
    end
